WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Jules Rivera: Thanks for making time. On our side we'd want to be clear what a co-production actually means before we talk numbers.

2
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Ingrid Halvorsen: Two series a year. We fund production, you handle distribution in your markets.

3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.000
Marcus Webb: And the split?

4
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Ingrid Halvorsen: Sixty forty, our way. That reflects where the production risk sits.

5
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Jules Rivera: That is not a starting point I can work with, Ingrid. We are bringing the audience.

6
00:00:53.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Ingrid Halvorsen: Then let us leave the split for now and keep talking about the slate.

7
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
Marcus Webb: We'll come back to you once we have modelled it on our side.
